config BR2_PACKAGE_CATALYST_UNITV
	bool "catalyst-unitv"
	help
	  What the shell installs on the smart camera (an M5Stack UnitV,
	  K210) over USB-A, with no microSD card: Sipeed's MaixPy v0.6.3
	  firmware (MIT and Apache-2.0), Sipeed's YOLOv2 face model (MIT),
	  kflash.py's K210 flash loader (MIT) and Catalyst's main.py, in
	  /usr/share/catalyst/unitv (2.6 MB), each with its source and
	  licence.

	  https://github.com/sipeed/MaixPy-v1
